%%{init: {'theme': 'dark', 'themeVariables': { 'primaryColor': '#10b981'}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant R as 🖼️ Renderer<br/>(renderer.js)
    participant P as 📡 Preload<br/>(preload.js)
    participant M as 🖥️ Main<br/>(index.js)
    participant S as ⚙️ Services
    participant MCP as 🤖 MCP Servers
    participant LM as 🧠 LM Studio
    
    Note over R,LM: Application Initialization
    
    R->>P: DOMContentLoaded
    P->>M: ipcRenderer.invoke('get-version')
    M-->>P: { version: '2.0.6' }
    P-->>R: version
    
    R->>P: Initialize LM Studio
    P->>M: ipcRenderer.invoke('lm-studio-connect', url)
    M->>S: lmStudioClient.connect(url)
    S->>LM: HTTP GET /v1/models
    LM-->>S: { models: [...] }
    S-->>M: { connected: true, models }
    M-->>P: status
    P-->>R: Update UI
    
    Note over R,LM: Chat Message Flow
    
    R->>P: User sends chat message
    P->>M: ipcRenderer.invoke('chatbot-message', msg)
    M->>S: chatbotService.processMessage(msg)
    
    alt Intent: Knowledge Query
        S->>MCP: evony_search(query)
        MCP-->>S: { results: [...] }
    else Intent: Calculation
        S->>MCP: calc_training(params)
        MCP-->>S: { result: {...} }
    else Intent: Protocol
        S->>MCP: protocol_lookup(id)
        MCP-->>S: { action: {...} }
    end
    
    S->>S: Build context from MCP results
    S->>LM: POST /v1/chat/completions
    LM-->>S: { response: '...' }
    S-->>M: formatted response
    M-->>P: response
    P-->>R: Display in chat
    
    Note over R,LM: Traffic Capture Flow
    
    R->>P: Webview traffic detected
    P->>M: ipcRenderer.send('traffic-captured', packet)
    M->>S: proxyMonitor.processPacket(packet)
    S->>S: Decode AMF3
    S->>S: Identify action
    S->>S: Update game state
    M->>P: mainWindow.webContents.send('traffic-update', entry)
    P->>R: Update traffic list
    
    Note over R,LM: Settings Flow
    
    R->>P: User saves settings
    P->>M: ipcRenderer.invoke('save-settings', settings)
    M->>S: store.set(settings)
    M->>S: lmStudioClient.updateSettings(settings.lmStudio)
    S->>LM: Reconnect if URL changed
    M-->>P: { success: true }
    P-->>R: Show confirmation
